@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folders/{folder_uuid}
actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "Контроллер RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER + USER_FOLDER_BINDING" as DB
queue "Транзакционный outbox" as OUT
queue "Типизированная задача проекции" as TASK
participant "Пул воркеров" as WORKER
database "Хранилище публичных событий" as EVENT
participant "Диспетчер WebSocket" as DISP
participant "Подписанный клиент" as WS
Client -> API: DELETE папки
note right of API
  Системная USER_FOLDER_BINDING этим маршрутом не удаляется.
  Проекция: активная USER_STREAM_BINDING + каноническая STREAM.is_archived = false.
  All chats = все; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false.
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; заблокировать папку в заданной области
API -> DB: удалить привязку/элементы + FOLDER через жизненный цикл FK
API -> OUT: добавить folder.deleted
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 204 пустой ответ
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid, scope=user-folder)
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
group одна worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: idempotent tombstone effect guard
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder.deleted {uuid}
end
DISP -> EVENT: читать/повторять/воспроизводить
DISP -> WS: folder.deleted
@enduml
